0..57 Comment "//! `moved-through` sends a file handle through a writer."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..139 Comment "//! The writer returns the handle. The parent closes the returned handle. The"
140..219 Comment "//! move twins refuse a repeated move or a post-move close as `UsedAfterClose`."
220..223 Comment "//!"
224..280 Comment "//! The trace tests settle the writer and parent events."
281..328 Comment "//! The source imports `File` from `file-base`."
